Well, only a small cheat... I used the bag of holding
sleaze to allow carrying out some extra loot:

 1   13980176  gerry-S ascended to demigod-hood.       298 [298]

Not a bad score... but what do you expect with ~2000 dilitium
crystals and diamonds?

All stats, without armor, were 18/** and 18.

Anyway:

Polymorph abuse:  I have the ultimate answer, and it is a real
imple one.  When using a WOP on a pile, reduce the probability
of a wand becoming a WOP.  At one point, I had 17 WOP.  Quite
useful for finding spellbooks and gems.

Dwarves are your friends, especially when you have numerous WOP.

Don't put a wand of cancellation in a bag of holding.

Magic is not powerful enough.  By the time my samuri had enough
intelligence and spells to use, he also had a +7 Mojo, 18/** 
strength and 22 dexterity.  Using a stethescope, I found that
single hits regularly did ~30 points of damage.  Magic can not
compete with this.  

Experience should be gained for activities other than beating monsters
over the head.  How about points for helping yourself out by gaining
intrinsics, or reading spellbooks, or casting spells?

Once you have survived beyond a certain point, dying is almost
impossible (especially when you have 7 amulets of life saving).  The
beginning of the game needs to be easier, and the ending more
challenging.  The final combat was a joke... especially after 7
dragons surrounded the samuri, and he charmed them all!

This game was moderately challenging.. no bones levels, one shop (on
level 22), but three alters - two lawful, one chaotic.

Hints:  keep your god happy.
Find a luckstone asap and bless it.
Good armor is the key to a long, happy life.

